Package: com.axs.ocr
Name: Axs ocr
Version: 5.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: 这是一款调用系统ocr识别的插件
 * 1. 在任意界面识别屏幕文字，结果可选择并一键复制。
 * 2. 通过深链接 prefs:root=axsocr_recognize 触发，可配合 GesturePro 手势使用。
Maintainer: Axs
Author: Axs
Section: Axs-Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
Icon: https://axs66.github.io/pro/icon/ocr.png
SileoDepiction: https://axs66.github.io/pro/sileodepiction/ocr/js.json
